WEBVTT

00:11:59.339 --> 00:12:01.300
because you're working with older people

00:12:01.341 --> 00:12:05.095
and you're fascinated
by the sphere, the area,

00:12:05.137 --> 00:12:08.140
the growth industry
of radical life extension.

00:12:08.474 --> 00:12:11.310
And hey, your first two degrees
didn't cost a thing,

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:13.479
and that second one,
East Asian Literature,

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.731
gave you a whole new perspective on life.

00:12:15.731 --> 00:12:18.025
You really loved
Japanese poetry after that.

00:12:18.942 --> 00:12:20.444
Pretty good, right?

00:12:20.444 --> 00:12:23.405
You get a notification
as you leave that lunch.

00:12:23.822 --> 00:12:27.659
Your local health care clinic's saying
you need to go for a quick checkup.

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.245
You go down there, you take a bus --